# What scripts/rename-issue-to-task.py leaves as "issue" (#190).
#
#   @group<TAB>why the group stays
#   group<TAB>path glob<TAB>regex: the spans it protects (none: the whole file)
#
# A glob's `*` crosses `/`. `--kept` prints every remaining hit under its group,
# and names any rule that no longer matches anything. Name a file the rename
# moves by its new name: a glob matches a path as it is and as it will be.

@script	The rename itself: this list and the script have to spell the word they rename.
script	scripts/rename-issue-to-task.py
script	scripts/rename-issue-to-task.keep

@github	A GitHub issue: GitHub's tracker, its API, its workflow events and the repository's contribution terms.
github	*	https?://github\.com/\S*
github	.github/workflows/cla.yml	\bissue_comment\b|github\.event\.issue\b
github	CLA.md
github	CONTRIBUTING.md
github	SECURITY.md
github	scripts/refresh-landing-activity.py
github	planning/v2/Tasks Spec.md	like GitHub issues
github	spa/src/core/previewText.js	\| Issue \| Verdict \|
github	spa/test/previewText.test.js	\| Issue \| Verdict \||Issue Verdict Evidence
github	spa/test/agentsOverviewFixture.js	\| Issue \| Verdict \||Skrift issue pipeline|Issue (?:fixer|auditor)|issue-implementation-audit
github	spa/test/agentOverviewDense.test.js	issue-implementation-audit|Issue Verdict Evidence
github	spa/test/browser/agentOverviewLayout.test.js	issue-implementation-audit
github	spa/test/browser/captureHeadingSlots.mjs	issue-implementation-audit

@third-party	Another product's issue: vendored dependency code, Linear's MCP tool, and the Do documents the 2026-08 redesign was planned in.
third-party	bridge/vendor/rtc/*
third-party	bridge/vendor/webrtc/*
third-party	bridge/src/harness/adk/tests/protocol_reader.rs	mcp__linear__create_issue
third-party	planning/v2/UX Redesign Decisions.md	five Do issues|an issue doc|the issue doc|the issue docs

@english	English that is not about the entity: the verb ("issue a request") or a problem ("zero issues").
english	*	start_issue_only_one_turn_start
english	spa/test/cacheSyncChanges.test.js	re-issues the active one
english	*	cert-manager issues fresh certs
english	*	Semgrep finds no issues
english	*	system exclusions; zero issues
english	*	may issue another greeting|can issue another|issues the subscribe|issues the ordinary typed|Do not issue another delivery
english	skriftapp/*	(?:re)?issue_invite|\bissue(?=\(client)|(?<=def )issue(?=\()|issues_an_invite|invite_issues_one_invite|\bissues? (?:a fresh|an invite)
english	design/landing-captures/capture.mjs	appHostIssues|(?<![-\w])issues?\b(?!-)
english	design/landing-captures/capture-results.json	"issues": \[\]

@history	Recorded history: gitleaks fingerprints of commits already on main, and the verbs the previous wire minor shipped.
history	.gitleaksignore
history	fixtures/api/verbs-*.json

@compat	Old spellings that links and data written before the rename still carry: read, never written.
compat	spa/src/core/router.js	LEGACY_TASKS_TAB = "issues"|LEGACY_PLAN_COLLECTION = "issue"|were `issues`, and a retired plan was `issue`|the old `issues` there
compat	spa/test/router.test.js	(?s)// Everything a link could say before issues were renamed.*?\n\}\);
compat	spa/src/core/renamedIds.js
compat	spa/test/renamedIds.test.js
compat	spa/test/trackerUnread.test.js	(?s)describe\("a mark cached before tasks were renamed \(#190\)".*?\n\}\);
compat	bridge/src/store.rs	issues/<task_id>/docs
compat	bridge/src/store/documents.rs	PLANS_DIR: &'static str = "issues"
compat	bridge/src/store/tests/documents.rs	join\("issues"\)
compat	bridge/src/store/tests/migrations.rs	issues/plan-1
compat	bridge/tests/real_store_migration.rs	join\("issues"\)|"issues dir"
compat	bridge/src/orchestrator/runs.rs	\.issue-docs
compat	bridge/src/orchestrator/tests/plans.rs	\.issue-docs
compat	bridge/src/resume.rs	`\*_issue`|comment_issue|old issue-…
compat	bridge/src/app/tests/resume.rs	`\*_issue`|comment_issue|old issue-…
compat	bridge/src/mcp.rs	"_issues?"|\b(?:comment|list|open)_issues?\b|"parent_issue_id"
compat	spa/src/core/taskCache.js	`#/issue/<id>`
compat	spa/src/views/taskView.js	#/issue/<id>
compat	bridge/src/renamed_ids.rs
compat	bridge/src/app/tests/renamed_ids.rs
compat	bridge/src/store/task_rename.rs
compat	bridge/src/store/tests/task_rename.rs
